WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:15.748
It’s project time! Make a character walk from home to the park in ScratchJr: choose a background, start with a green flag, use arrow blocks with numbers, and share it with a friend.

2
00:00:16.348 --> 00:00:20.626
Your character goes from home to the park.

3
00:00:20.626 --> 00:00:24.035
Plan the path with arrows first.

4
00:00:24.635 --> 00:00:30.217
In ScratchJr, tap the picture button to choose a park background.

5
00:00:30.817 --> 00:00:36.835
Use arrow blocks with numbers to walk your character to the slide.

6
00:00:37.435 --> 00:00:41.713
Press the green flag and show your trip.

7
00:00:41.713 --> 00:00:44.687
What did your friend like?

8
00:00:45.287 --> 00:00:51.304
Walk the child from home to the slide (star). Follow the path.

9
00:00:51.304 --> 00:00:55.148
You made it to the park! Wheee!

10
00:00:55.748 --> 00:00:59.591
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

11
00:00:59.591 --> 00:01:04.739
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
